OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein 'content' with 1998
OL,4,Abombing campaign, Omagh inquiry told
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein First Minister Michelle
OL,7,FO'Neill said "I absolutely do not agree
OL,8,Fwith his commentary or his view of
OL,9,Fthings" adding that her party was
OL,10,F"unequivocal in our condemnation of the
OL,11,FOmagh bombing".
